type: software
title: "Heat-alert exposure in Japan: exposure-side data pipeline"
abstract: "Reproducible exposure-side data pipeline for a study of Japan's Heatstroke Alert at fire-department resolution. Service areas are anonymized; no heat-illness transport records are included."
